<view class="page report-page"><view class="report-head"><text class="overline">WEEKLY FIRST BITE</text><text class="title">本周惜食报告</text><text class="range">{{report.weekStart}} — {{report.weekEnd}}</text></view>
<view wx:if="{{report.hasData}}"><view class="hero-stat card"><view class="ring" style="background:conic-gradient(#789176 {{report.completionRate}}%,#e8e5dc 0)"><view>{{report.completionRate}}%</view></view><view><text class="hero-title">优先食材完成率</text><text class="hero-sub">完成 {{report.priorityCompleted}} / {{report.priorityTotal}} 份本周优先食材</text></view></view>
<view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">冰箱动态</text></view><view class="bars card"><view><view class="bar-label"><text>新增食材</text><text class="bar-number">{{report.ingredientsAdded}}</text></view><view class="track"><view class="fill sage" style="width:{{report.addedBar}}%"></view></view></view><view><view class="bar-label"><text>完成食用</text><text class="bar-number">{{report.ingredientsConsumed}}</text></view><view class="track"><view class="fill orange" style="width:{{report.consumedBar}}%"></view></view></view></view>
<view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">令令的收获</text></view><view class="rewards"><view class="reward card"><text>🌱</text><text class="reward-number">+{{report.xpEarned}}</text><text class="reward-label">XP 经验</text></view><view class="reward card"><text>⭐</text><text class="reward-number">{{report.pointsText}}</text><text class="reward-label">积分变化</text></view><view class="reward card"><text>🎀</text><text class="reward-number">{{report.newOutfits}}</text><text class="reward-label">新装扮</text></view></view></view>
<view wx:else class="empty-report card"><text class="empty-icon">📖</text><text class="empty-title">这一周的故事刚刚开始</text><text>添加食材并记录食用后，真实数据会自动生成在这里。</text></view>
<view class="quote">“每一次优先吃完，都是对食物温柔的回应。”</view></view>
